<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">MKINITRAMFS / INSPECTION</p>
    <h1>lsmkinitramfs</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        List the files stored inside a compressed initramfs image using the
        configured compression format and <code>bsdcpio</code>.
    </p>

    <div class="command-line"># lsmkinitramfs &lt;image&gt;</div>
</section>

<section class="doc-grid">
    <aside class="toc">
        <p class="toc-title">lsmkinitramfs</p>
        <a href="#/mkinitramfs/">Manuals</a>
        <a href="#/mkinitramfs/lsmkinitramfs#usage">Usage</a>
        <a href="#/mkinitramfs/lsmkinitramfs#checks">Checks</a>
    </aside>

    <article class="doc">
        <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>

        <pre><code>lsmkinitramfs /boot/initrd-linux.img
lsmkinitramfs /boot/initrd-linux.img | less
lsmkinitramfs /boot/initrd-linux.img | grep -E '(^|/)init$|modules|udev'</code></pre>

        <p>
            The tool reads <code>INITFSCOMP</code> to choose the decompressor,
            then passes the resulting cpio stream to <code>bsdcpio</code>. It
            does not boot or modify the image.
        </p>

        <h2 id="checks">Useful checks</h2>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Check</th>
                    <th>Reason</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>

            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <code>^init$</code>
                    </td>

                    <td>Confirms the image has its entrypoint.</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <code>etc/udev</code>
                    </td>

                    <td>Confirms udev payload and rules are present.</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <code>lib/modules</code>
                    </td>

                    <td>Confirms kernel modules were included.</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <code>cryptsetup</code>
                    </td>

                    <td>Required when using the encrypt hook.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>Exit status is non-zero if no image is provided or the archive cannot be read.</p>
    </article>
</section>
